<title>USA: TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $303,000 Infiniti Open men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First Round:</p>
<p>5-Patrick Rafter (Austrlia) beat Lionel Roux (France) 7-6 (7-3) 6-7 (3-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Vincent Spadea (U.S.) beat Stephane Simian (France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Michael Tebbutt (Australia) 2-6 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Sebastian Lareau (Canada) 7-6 (7-4) 6-1.</p>
</text>
